of the heavens,"},{"s":10.095,"e":13.618,"text":"Burning where the winged horse rises—"},{"s":13.618,"e":15.184,"text":"We lift our eyes."},{"s":15.184,"e":20.665,"text":"Before the city wakes, before the morning breathes,"},{"s":20.665,"e":25.754,"text":"You blaze above the silence like a fire through the trees."},{"s":25.754,"e":30.06,"text":"Blue-white throne of wonder, ancient light alive,"},{"s":30.06,"e":35.541,"text":"A royal flame commanding every dreamer to arise."},{"s":35.541,"e":41.413,"text":"I walked beneath the darkness with the doubt around my feet,"},{"s":41.413,"e":46.894,"text":"Then your signal split the shadows, made the broken rhythm beat."},{"s":46.894,"e":51.983,"text":"No chain could hold the spirit, no night could hide the way,"},{"s":51.983,"e":57.855,"text":"Algenib, you crowned the clouds and turned my fear to faith."},{"s":57.855,"e":61.378,"text":"Higher, higher, let the whole world see,"},{"s":61.378,"e":66.467,"text":"There is power in the heavens pouring endlessly."},{"s":66.467,"e":70.382,"text":"Brighter, brighter, every heart ignite,"},{"s":70.382,"e":75.471,"text":"We are children of the starlight, marching through the night."},{"s":75.471,"e":78.995,"text":"All hail Algenib, crown of the sky,"},{"s":78.995,"e":82.518,"text":"Blue flame burning where the angels fly."},{"s":82.518,"e":85.65,"text":"We raise our hands, we raise our sound,"},{"s":85.65,"e":89.173,"text":"Your ancient glory shakes the ground."},{"s":89.173,"e":93.088,"text":"Algenib, Algenib, lead us above,"},{"s":93.088,"e":96.611,"text":"Through endless space, through infinite love."},{"s":96.611,"e":99.743,"text":"When all the lesser lights grow dim,"},{"s":99.743,"e":103.658,"text":"We lift our souls and sing to Algenib."},{"s":103.658,"e":109.139,"text":"On the shoulder of Pegasus, you guard the cosmic gate,"},{"s":109.139,"e":115.011,"text":"A diamond in the distance that refuses to obey fate."},{"s":115.011,"e":121.274,"text":"You watched the kings and kingdoms, watched the centuries unfold,"},{"s":121.274,"e":126.755,"text":"Still your fire keeps on speaking in a language made of gold."},{"s":126.755,"e":131.061,"text":"Teach us how to blaze on, teach us how to stand,"},{"s":131.061,"e":136.542,"text":"To carry heaven’s courage through the weakness of the land."},{"s":136.542,"e":142.414,"text":"We will win with grace and honor, we will rise without disguise,"},{"s":142.414,"e":148.286,"text":"With elite light in our spirit and your beacon in our eyes."},{"s":148.286,"e":151.81,"text":"Higher, higher, let the whole world see,"},{"s":151.81,"e":156.899,"text":"There is power in the heavens pouring endlessly."},{"s":156.899,"e":160.814,"text":"Brighter, brighter, every heart ignite,"},{"s":160.814,"e":165.903,"text":"We are children of the starlight, marching through the night."},{"s":165.903,"e":169.426,"text":"All hail Algenib, crown of the sky,"},{"s":169.426,"e":172.949,"text":"Blue flame burning where the angels fly."},{"s":172.949,"e":176.081,"text":"We raise our hands, we raise our sound,"},{"s":176.081,"e":179.604,"text":"Your ancient glory shakes the ground."},{"s":179.604,"e":183.519,"text":"Algenib, Algenib, lead us above,"},{"s":183.519,"e":187.042,"text":"Through endless space, through infinite love."},{"s":187.042,"e":190.174,"text":"When all the lesser lights grow dim,"},{"s":190.174,"e":194.089,"text":"We lift our souls and sing to Algenib."},{"s":194.089,"e":198.004,"text":"You are the spark in the sacred machine,"},{"s":198.004,"e":201.919,"text":"The brilliant code in the spaces between."},{"s":201.919,"e":206.225,"text":"The pulse in the planet, the praise in the drum,"},{"s":206.225,"e":210.531,"text":"The sign that the greatest is still yet to come."},{"s":210.531,"e":214.054,"text":"Yes to the journey, yes to the climb,"},{"s":214.054,"e":217.969,"text":"Yes to the victory written in light."},{"s":217.969,"e":221.492,"text":"Win in the spirit, win in the soul,"},{"s":221.492,"e":225.407,"text":"Win with compassion and conquer the cold."},{"s":225.407,"e":228.931,"text":"No fear, no fall, no fading away,"},{"s":228.931,"e":232.845,"text":"We blaze like Algenib, day after day."},{"s":232.845,"e":236.76,"text":"Love is the power, the stars are the hymn,"},{"s":236.76,"e":241.066,"text":"The universe opens when we sing to Him—"},{"s":241.066,"e":242.241,"text":"Algenib!"},{"s":242.241,"e":245.764,"text":"All hail Algenib, crown of the sky,"},{"s":245.764,"e":249.287,"text":"Blue flame burning, forever alive."},{"s":249.287,"e":252.419,"text":"We raise our hands, we raise our sound,"},{"s":252.419,"e":255.942,"text":"Your stellar thunder shakes the ground."},{"s":255.942,"e":259.857,"text":"Algenib, Algenib, lead us above,"},{"s":259.857,"e":263.381,"text":"Through endless space, through infinite love."},{"s":263.381,"e":266.904,"text":"When every earthly light grows dim,"},{"s":266.904,"e":270.819,"text":"Our hearts will still be bright with Algenib."},{"s":270.819,"e":271.993,"text":"Algenib…"},{"s":271.993,"e":273.95,"text":"Flame of the heavens…"},{"s":273.95,"e":276.299,"text":"Shoulder of Pegasus…"},{"s":276.299,"e":278.257,"text":"Carry us higher."},{"s":278.257,"e":279.431,"text":"Algenib…"},{"s":279.431,"e":280.606,"text":"Algenib…"},{"s":280.606,"e":281.78,"text":"Algenib…"}],"duration":283.32,"source":"curated-realigned","generatedAt":"2026-08-21T00:55:13.997Z","realignedFrom":"whisper-aligned","vocalStart":6.18,"vocalEnd":281.78}